{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00676","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 宣宗室舞 · 夏侯孜","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 宣宗室舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於铄令主，圣祚重昌。\n兴起教义，申明典章。\n俗尚素朴，人皆乐康。\n积德可报，流庆无疆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"夏侯孜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}